			"notes": "## OS Cobblemon Library 1.5.0\n\nFor Minecraft 1.21.1, Java 21, Fabric and NeoForge, with Cobblemon 1.8.2 and 1.8.3.\n\n### Added\n\n- Add `PokemonEVs` helpers to inspect registered permanent stats, take EV snapshots, calculate totals and apply source-aware EV changes.\n- Add Java hooks for Cobblemon evolution eligibility checks through `CobblemonEventHooks.onEvolutionTested`.\n- Accept `ResourceLocation` keys in persistent Pokémon data helpers.\n- Add focused common-module tests for defensive snapshots and grouped event subscription lifecycle.\n\n### Changed\n\n- Support Cobblemon `1.8.2+1.21.1` and `1.8.3+1.21.1` on Fabric and NeoForge.\n- Build both loaders against Cobblemon 1.8.2 and 1.8.3 in CI.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Clear the nearest-player distance cache automatically when Fabric or NeoForge servers stop, preventing cached entity data from carrying over between server lifecycles.\n\n### Removed\n\n- None."
		},
